@startuml @medusajs/workflows-sdk Architecture
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica Neue"

title @medusajs/framework/workflows-sdk — Execution Model (v2.15.4)

' ======== Author API ========
package "Workflow Author API" {
  component [createStep()] as CreateStep
  component [createWorkflow()] as CreateWorkflow
  component [transform()] as Transform
  component [when().then()] as When
  component [parallelize()] as Parallelize
  component [createHook()] as CreateHook
  component [StepResponse] as StepResp
  component [WorkflowResponse] as WFResp
}

' ======== Composition ========
package "Composition Phase (definition time)" {
  component [WorkflowData<T>\n(Proxy)] as WFData
  component [TransactionStepsDefinition\n(DAG)] as DAG
  component [Step Registry] as StepReg
}

' ======== Execution ========
package "Execution Phase (runtime)" {
  component [ReturnWorkflow\n.run() / .runAsStep() / .hooks] as ReturnWF
}

' ======== Orchestration ========
package "@medusajs/orchestration" {
  component [DistributedTransaction\nManager] as TxMgr
  component [Compensation Stack\n(LIFO on failure)] as CompStack
  interface "IDistributedTransactionStorage" as IStorage
  component [InMemoryStorage\n(dev/tests)] as InMemStor
  component [RedisStorage\n(production)] as RedisStor
  database "Transaction State" as TxState
}

' ======== Step Execution ========
package "Step Runtime" {
  component [invokeFn(input, ctx)] as InvokeFn
  component [compensateFn(data, ctx)] as CompFn
  component [StepExecutionContext\n(container, context, metadata)] as StepCtx
}

' ======== DI ========
package "DI Container" {
  component [MedusaContainer\n(Awilix — request scope)] as Container
  component [Module Services] as ModSvc
}

' ======== Connections ========

' Composition
CreateStep --> StepReg
CreateStep --> WFData
CreateWorkflow --> DAG
Transform --> DAG
When --> DAG
Parallelize --> DAG
CreateHook --> DAG
DAG --> WFData

' Execution
CreateWorkflow --> ReturnWF
ReturnWF --> TxMgr : ".run()"

' Orchestration internals
TxMgr --> IStorage
IStorage <|.. InMemStor
IStorage <|.. RedisStor
InMemStor --> TxState
RedisStor --> TxState
TxMgr --> CompStack

' Step execution
TxMgr --> InvokeFn : "invoke step"
InvokeFn --> StepResp
StepResp --> CompStack : "push compensationData"
CompStack --> CompFn : "on failure (LIFO)"

' Context
InvokeFn --> StepCtx
CompFn --> StepCtx
StepCtx --> Container
Container --> ModSvc

' Final output
InvokeFn --> WFResp

note right of WFData
  WorkflowData<T> is a Proxy.
  It cannot be read in the
  composer — only passed as
  step input or to transform().
  The engine resolves it at
  execution time.
end note

note bottom of CompStack
  On step failure:
  • Pop compensationData
  • Call compensateFn(data, ctx)
  • Repeat LIFO until empty
  • Rethrow original error
  Compensation failures are
  logged but do not halt
  the compensation chain.
end note

note right of RedisStor
  Enabled when
  projectConfig.redisUrl
  is set. Supports durable,
  resumable workflows across
  process restarts.
end note

@enduml
